# Every panel opened as a person opens it (its keyboard shortcut; the arena's
# mod key is ALT), recorded, then closed, recorded. Compare per panel, QML vs
# Rust: start (command → first moving frame), duration (±10 %), frames,
# longest gap. PASS: Rust start ≤ QML start; duration within ±10 %; Rust's
# longest gap ≤ QML's + 17 ms. (parity/latency.md, steps 1–2; batch 1)
look glass
ptr move 1500 600
wait 2

# Control Center: ALT + C
rec cc-open 1.6 key -M alt -k c -m alt
rec cc-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
# Spotlight: ALT + Space
rec spotlight-open 1.6 key -M alt -k space -m alt
rec spotlight-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Notification Center: ALT + N
rec nc-open 1.6 key -M alt -k n -m alt
rec nc-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
# Launchpad: ALT + CTRL + Space
rec launchpad-open 1.6 key -M alt -M ctrl -k space -m ctrl -m alt
rec launchpad-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Overview: ALT + Tab
rec overview-open 1.6 key -M alt -k Tab -m alt
rec overview-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Mission Control: ALT + SHIFT + Tab
rec missioncontrol-open 1.6 key -M alt -M shift -k Tab -m shift -m alt
rec missioncontrol-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Sidebar: ALT + A
rec sidebar-open 1.6 key -M alt -k a -m alt
rec sidebar-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
# Clipboard: ALT + V
rec clipboard-open 1.6 key -M alt -k v -m alt
rec clipboard-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Emoji: ALT + Period
rec emoji-open 1.6 key -M alt -k period -m alt
rec emoji-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Wallpaper picker: CTRL + ALT + T
rec wallpaper-open 1.6 key -M ctrl -M alt -k t -m alt -m ctrl
rec wallpaper-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Power menu: CTRL + ALT + Delete
rec session-open 1.6 key -M ctrl -M alt -k Delete -m alt -m ctrl
rec session-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Cheatsheet: ALT + Slash
rec cheatsheet-open 1.6 key -M alt -k slash -m alt
rec cheatsheet-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Quick Note: ALT + N with ALT (the bind names ALT twice: ALT + N); by IPC
rec quicknote-open 1.6 ipc panels open quickNote IRICE-TEST
rec quicknote-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# Screen tools: ALT + Print
rec screentools-open 1.6 key -M alt -k Print -m alt
rec screentools-close 1.4 key -k Escape
wait 1
# The status menus and the system menu (opened from the menu bar: by IPC here)
rec sound-open 1.6 ipc panels open soundMenu IRICE-TEST
rec sound-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
rec battery-open 1.6 ipc panels open batteryMenu IRICE-TEST
rec battery-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
rec bluetooth-open 1.6 ipc panels open bluetoothMenu IRICE-TEST
rec bluetooth-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
rec systemmenu-open 1.6 ipc panels open systemMenu IRICE-TEST
rec systemmenu-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
# Clicks on the menu bar (check the coordinates with the first shot)
shot menubar-before-clicks
rec cc-click 1.6 ptr move 1895 14 click
rec cc-click-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
rec clock-click 1.6 ptr move 1680 14 click
rec clock-click-close 1.4 ipc panels close
wait 1
# The window switcher: ALT + Tab held (needs two windows)
setup foot >/dev/null 2>&1 & sleep 1; foot >/dev/null 2>&1 &
wait 2
rec switcher-open 1.6 key -M alt -k Tab
rec switcher-commit 1.2 key -m alt
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'; sleep 0.5; hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
note per panel: Rust start ≤ QML start; durations within 10 %; no Rust gap over QML's + 17 ms
note the same as latency-panels.steps, in Glass
